  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.0.26: Add net3000.common.Services.ThemeAuthoring - ThemeAuthoringService (theme save, deep duplicate, HTML-to-blocks view import/re-import, block save, declarative view composition) and ThemePageCodes, moved out of net3000.core ThemesController so the AccountsMCP theme tools share the admin rules (net3000-ca/applications#3085). Additive API only. 10.0.25: Add lib.ResolveSocialImage / lib.GetSocialImagePool - shared og:image resolution (metaTagFeatureImage -> featureImage -> account socialImagePool setting) for every app's meta-tag builder. Pool is opt-in by absence: accounts with no socialImagePool row resolve to null and emit no og:image, as before. Additive API only. 10.0.24: Depend on Portable.BouncyCastle 1.9.0 instead of BouncyCastle.NetCore 2.2.1. Both shipped a file named BouncyCastle.Crypto.dll with incompatible identities (1.9.0.0 signed vs 0.0.0.0 unsigned); last-writer-wins resolution broke WebPush's strong-named bind on deployed hosts. No API change - the crypto code compiles unchanged and ciphertext is byte-for-byte identical. Also drops dangling BouncyCastle.Crypto and HtmlAgilityPack assembly-reference HintPaths pointing into gitignored bin folders. 10.0.23: Add IListUnsubscribeLookup contract so app audience providers can subtract per-list unsubscribes without referencing mailingListDB. 10.0.22: Bootstrap 5 dual-compatibility in emitted admin nav markup - the two nav-dropdown emitters now emit data-bs-toggle alongside data-toggle so the markup drives dropdowns under both Bootstrap 4 and 5 (epic net3000-ca/applications#1764, issue #1795). No API changes. 10.0.21: Restore assembly name to 'common' (10.0.20 shipped as net3000.common.dll, breaking Net3000.Content's contentDB reference).",
